      <title>Creating customized openSUSE versions with SUSE Studio</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>openSUSE</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;SUSE Studio is a new web application to build openSUSE based appliances. It provides an easy to use interface to quickly create images for live CDs, &#xA;bootable USB sticks and VMware. It&amp;#39;s also possible to conveniently customize software selection, configuration and theming of the appliances. Third party software may be integrated through coupling with the openSUSE Build Service.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Studio&amp;#39;s testdrive feature allows users to run the appliance via the web interface for testing and further configuration.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We will present the concepts behind SUSE Studio and demonstrate how to easily create a customized openSUSE version in five minutes.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
